\section{Discussion}

 Use \texttt{natbib.sty} as the main bibliography style. See the following example:
\begin{itemize}
\item \texttt{A. T. B., \emph{A. B.}, and \emph{A. B.}, ``Title of a paper,'' \emph{Journal Title} \textbf{123} (1994), \emph{A. B.}}
\end{itemize}

